<title>INDIA: Indian call money market inactive as RBI closed.</title>
<headline>Indian call money market inactive as RBI closed.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The call money market was inactive on Monday as the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) was closed for public business while it finalised its annual accounts, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight money quotes opened the day at 5.0-5.50 percent and closed at 4.25-4.75 percent with no trades, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
